---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import '../../styles/global.css';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy – Beaver Habit Tracker (iOS)" description="Privacy Policy for Beaver Habit Tracker iOS app">
  <main class="flex justify-center px-4 py-8 sm:py-12">
    <article class="w-full max-w-2xl space-y-8 text-gray-300 leading-relaxed border border-gray-700/50 rounded-2xl p-8 sm:p-12">
      <header class="space-y-2">
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Beaver Habit Tracker for iOS · Effective April 4, 2026</p>
      </header>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">1. Data Collection</h2>
        <p>Beaver Habit Tracker for iOS stores all habit data locally on your device. We do not collect, transmit, or store any personal information on our servers unless you explicitly enable cloud sync with a self-hosted server.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">2. Cloud Sync (Optional)</h2>
        <p>If you choose to connect to a Beaver Habits server, your habit data is synced to that server. We do not operate a centralized cloud service; you control where your data is stored.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">3. Analytics & Tracking</h2>
        <p>We do not use any third-party analytics, advertising, or tracking SDKs.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">4. Data Sharing</h2>
        <p>We do not sell, share, or disclose your data to any third parties.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">5. Data Deletion</h2>
        <p>You can delete all your data at any time by removing the app from your device. If you use cloud sync, you can delete your account and data from your server.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">6. Contact</h2>
        <p>If you have questions about this policy, please contact us at <a href="https://github.com/daya0576/beaverhabits/issues" class="text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300 underline underline-offset-2">GitHub Issues</a>.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">7. Changes</h2>
        <p>We may update this policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page.</p>
      </section>

      <footer class="pt-6 border-t border-gray-700/50 text-sm text-gray-500">
        © 2026 Changjian Zhu. All rights reserved.
      </footer>
    </article>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
